            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Notas da Atualização</h1><p><strong>Wildlife update 2.0</strong><br><br>We've been busy, real busy. We love feedback from players, family and friends. Here are a list of the latest update for Wildlife VR.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> New textures and materials for the whole game.<br></li><li> Added a new gun (Sniper-rifle).<br></li><li> Reworked shotgun, should be &quot;usable&quot; now.<br></li><li> You are now able to select weapons for each controller (Thumb button).<br></li><li> New animal (Boar).<br></li><li> New level (Boar-level).<br></li><li> Reworked revolver model.<br></li><li> Thermos are now physics object.<br></li><li> More cans and TVs for shooting-range level.<br></li><li> Deer scale reworked, should now be more natural size.<br></li><li> Ducks have batter flying-paths.<br></li><li> Sound when hitting an animal to confirm hit.<br></li><li> Shotgun reload sound is now synced.<br></li><li> Deer should only generate one point per hit.<br></li><li> Lightning reworked for every level.</li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>A virtual reality hunting game. Choose between shooting flying ducks in random patterns, hunting a deer or a boar in the open. Every score point you'll get the animals become harder to hit. It's a bit of a relaxing &quot;outdoors&quot; game with low poly graphics. Wildlife VR is perfect for first-time-vr-experience since it's not hard to jump straight into. Choose between three different weapons; Revolver, Shotgun or Sniper-rifle.",
            "about_the_game": "A virtual reality hunting game. Choose between shooting flying ducks in random patterns, hunting a deer or a boar in the open. Every score point you'll get the animals become harder to hit. It's a bit of a relaxing &quot;outdoors&quot; game with low poly graphics. Wildlife VR is perfect for first-time-vr-experience since it's not hard to jump straight into. Choose between three different weapons; Revolver, Shotgun or Sniper-rifle.",
            "short_description": "A virtual reality hunting game, where you can shoot ducks, a deer, a boar, cans and TVs.",
