                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Do not buy this game! At least in its current state. Its so fuzzy that it makes the game basically unplayable. Nothing is scaled right, the ducks are like 4 feet big and the deer are like 2 feet big. I literal have to let the game run for 5 minutes just so I can make this review because I can't get through 5 minutes of playing this game. I will keep only because it was $3 but I suggest you keep your $3 and buy some soda or a piece of candy.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1468719758,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1468719758,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 29,
                        "votes_funny": 6,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.6780201196670532,
                        "comment_count": 1,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Thank you for your feedback. The scale for the duck are a bit large for easy targeting, we've increased the size of the deer to make the game more enjoyable. I hope you like the new version and that you are able to play for more than five minutes. Give the new level a try with the new weapon and you might like the game. We've also reworked the shotgun to be more accurate, less spread.\n\nYour feedback is much appreciated.\n\n/GameDev",
